{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03405","headline":"送梁卿王郎中使东蕃吊册 · 崔湜","name":"送梁卿王郎中使东蕃吊册","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁侯上卿秀，王子中台杰。\n赠册绥九夷，旌旃下双阙。\n西堂礼乐送，南陌轩车别。\n征路入海云，行舟泝江月。\n兹邦久钦化，历载归朝谒。\n皇心谅所嘉，寄尔宣风烈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}